# Video curation (scripts/yt.mjs) needs a YouTube Data API v3 key.
# This is free, unrelated to any AI subscription, and works on any Google account:
#   1. console.cloud.google.com → create/pick a project
#   2. APIs & Services → Library → enable "YouTube Data API v3"
#   3. APIs & Services → Credentials → Create credentials → API key
# Quota: 10,000 units/day; a search costs 100 → ~100 searches/day. Plenty.
#
# Copy this file to .env and paste the key in. .env is gitignored.

GOOGLE_API_KEY=
